      "value": "本条只写 OpenSourceAP/CrossSection 可执行核 Lakonishok, Shleifer and Vishny (1994) MeanRankRevGrowth。年6月末：每年按收入同比对数增长排序得秩，MeanRankRevGrowth=(5·Rank_{t−1}+4·Rank_{t−2}+3·Rank_{t−3}+2·Rank_{t−4}+1·Rank_{t−5})/15；剔除NASDAQ；等权五分位做多最高MeanRankRevGrowth、做空最低，持12月。Sign=+1。不是目录核M0421（仅Signal Browser定义）；不是AssetGrowth/InvGrowth/GrSaleToGrInv近核；不是SMA200闸。"
